{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":232,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"bbb7c90d-4de0-48ab-a4a3-207f1bb66d53","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561121035,"PostDateInt":1744256638000,"PostDate":"2025-04-10T11:43:58","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"产品线负责人（车载后装方向）(J12771)","OrgId":3145384,"Org":"产品管理中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"40K-55K 元/月","Duty":"1. 对市场及客户需求进行调研分析，将需求产品化;\n2. 主导研发项目立项，管理和把控项目进度/成本/质量，确保产品满足客户需求;\n3. 深度客户/市场洞察并提炼输出报告以支撑立项逻辑，持续产品迭代和定价成本优化，确保产品竞争力;\n4. 产品生命周期管理，确保产品经营目标达成。","Require":"1. 本科5年以上学历，计算机或通信相关专业;\n2. 有车载后装行业相关经验, 对市场趋势和行业发展深入了解；\n3. 熟悉各个芯片平台，软件SE或架构师经验优先;\n4. 有责任心，良好的组织协调、沟通能力，推动跨团队合作、促使项目计划按时完成。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"1","ChangeDate":"2025-04-10T11:43:58","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"5a6dde47-d208-4291-be1d-5ec291646b46","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561316336,"PostDateInt":1792554815000,"PostDate":"2026-10-21T11:53:35","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"射频工程师(J14313)","OrgId":700519302,"Org":"计算解决方案事业群","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"20K-40K 元/月","Duty":"工作职责\n1.射频电路开发：负责消费类产品的射频电路方案设计，包括 2G-5G Modem射频链路设计，以及 GPS/GNSS、NFC、Wi-Fi、BT/BLE 等多通信模块的射频设计与调试\n2.器件选型与原理图设计：负责射频关键器件（PA、LNA、滤波器、开关、射频收发器等）的选型评估，完成射频原理图绘制及 BOM 制作\n3.PCB 评审与天线协作：指导及评审 PCB Layout 走线，协助结构工程师设计天线净空区域，与天线厂商协作完成天线设计、仿真、评估与选型\n4.调试与性能优化：负责射频传导调试，使用网络分析仪、频谱仪、综测仪、信号源等仪器完成输出功率、接收灵敏度等指标的调试与优化\n5.问题攻关与量产支持：解决从开发到量产过程中的 desense、EMC、产线测试及认证（CCC/无委/海外认证）等相关问题。","Require":"任职资格\n1.本科及以上学历，电子工程、通信工程、电磁场与微波技术等相关专业\n2.五年以上射频电路开发经验，具备消费类产品射频开发项目经验\n3.熟悉2G-5G射频设计，熟悉蜂窝通信系统原理及射频指标要求\n4.熟悉 GPS/GNSS、NFC、Wi-Fi、BT/BLE 等短距通信模块的射频电路原理、设计与调试\n5.具备扎实的射频微波理论基础，精通阻抗匹配、S参数、史密斯圆图等\n6.熟练使用 EDA 工具（Cadence Allegro / PADS / Altium Designer 等）进行射频原理图设计和 PCB 评审\n7.熟练使用矢量网络分析仪、频谱分析仪、无线综合测试仪、信号源等射频测试仪器\n8.责任心强，具备良好的团队协作和沟通能力，能独立分析和解决射频技术问题","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-21T11:53:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"dc681536-f577-45e5-ba99-6e40d1f05f50","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561315568,"PostDateInt":1792379916000,"PostDate":"2026-10-19T11:18:36","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"AI产品经理（FDE）(J14330)","OrgId":1568638,"Org":"流程与IT管理部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"20K-30K 元/月","Duty":"1、岗位定位\n企业 AI 落地的核心执行角色，覆盖研发、智能制造、供应链、营销、运营、服务等全业务环节，独立/牵头负责 AI 产品从需求调研&PRD 输出、方案设计、原型搭建、研发管理、测试上线到推广运营、迭代优化的全生命周期管理，沉淀可复用模板与方法论。\n2、战略价值\n聚焦业务场景高价值AI 方案 +AI能力边界和选型两条主线，把模糊业务诉求转化为高效、高可用的产品，建立评估标准与价值闭环机制，驱动公司提效降本与能力升级。\n3、关键能力：\n①AI产品方案设计：精通  LLM / AIGC / RAG /RPA/知识工程/Dify等主流 AI 技术的能力边界，熟悉前沿AI产品以及应用场景，以人机协同的逻辑进行场景的0基重塑，定义可落地、高适配性的AI 产品方案、产品原型。\n②需求洞察与场景挖掘：深入业务一线，精准捕捉业务域流程各环节核心痛点，挖掘高价值AI 落地场景，有效定义产品需求，明确产品功能、技术选型与可量化的价值目标。\n③AI 产品落地执行：具备从需求到运营全流程的项目管控能力，能高效协同研发、IT、业务等多团队；AI产品的技术评审能力；\n④价值量化与持续迭代：设计评估体系，量化AI场景落地后的降本/提效/提质等核心业务价值，持续跟踪用户反馈与业务数据，快速迭代调优，提升产品适配性、易用性与用户使用率。\n⑤AI打法沉淀与运营：配合团队在企业内部统一AI语言，能用业务语言翻译 AI 技术价值，持续沉淀AI建设/运营打法，持续建设并推广企业AI文化","Require":"1.年限：3年AI产品经理或 AI 解决方案经理经验\n2.行业：通信、半导体、消费电子、智能制造企业内部 AI 落地经验优先\n3.业务熟悉度：高科技企业/智能制造企业研发、供应链、生产、营销、交付单领域全流程熟悉\n4.成果要求：有 AI 技术与实体业务深度结合的成功案例3个及以上，企业级 AI 产品从 0 到 1落地经验/经历\n5.专业：AIGC相关专业、IT技术相关专业优先\n6.特质画像：兼具产品思维+用户思维的AI产品高潜","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-19T11:18:36","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"63d736b6-a951-4e3d-9689-65cd86073bc2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561293524,"PostDateInt":1787882010000,"PostDate":"2026-08-28T09:53:30","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级SLAM算法工程师(J14138)","OrgId":700264960,"Org":"算法开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"30K-40K 元/月","Duty":"1. 负责3D激光/视觉SLAM系统研发，针对户外草坪、园林等非结构化场景，构建高精度、可持久化的稠密/半稠密地图；\n2. 设计多源融合定位框架（LiDAR/Visual/IMU/RTK-GNSS/UWB），解决移动机器人长直路径特征退化及机剧烈运动模糊问题，实现厘米级绝对定位；\n3. 研发跨会话（Cross-session）重定位与地图更新算法，支持多季节/昼夜环境变化下的稳定复用，以及在不同任务间的快速重定位；\n4. 探索语义SLAM与3DGS/NeRF技术，提升对植被、栅栏、坑洼等软性障碍物的几何重建与语义理解能力，为下游规划提供可靠环境模型；\n5. 主导SLAM算法在嵌入式平台（如Orin/RK3588）上的性能剖析与加速，确保在低功耗约束下满足实时性指标。","Require":"1. 硕士及以上学历，计算机、自动化、机器人等相关专业，3年以上SLAM算法量产落地经验，有户外移动机器人完整项目经历者优先；\n2. 精通因子图优化理论（GTSAM/Ceres/iSAM2），深入理解LIO-SAM/FAST-LIO/VINS-Fusion等算法内核，并有针对低纹理/高动态场景的深度魔改经验；\n3. 差异化技能（满足其一即可）：\n    轮式方向：精通RTK-GNSS/LiDAR紧耦合融合，熟悉草坪场景下的回环检测与轨迹对齐，了解轮速计打滑补偿机制；\n    足式方向：熟悉Leg Odometry或接触预积分，掌握IMU在高频冲击震动下的噪声建模与外参在线标定；\n4. 扎实的C++/CUDA编程能力，熟练使用TensorRT/OpenVINO进行算子优化，有ARM架构嵌入式部署实战经验；\n5. 具备大规模户外数据集评测能力，对算法在光照剧变、雨雪雾、植被遮挡等Corner Case下的鲁棒性有极致追求；\n6. 加分项：有ROS2中间件定制开发经验；发表过ICRA/IROS/RAL SLAM相关论文；有数字孪生仿真或三维重建工具链开发经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-28T09:53:30","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"0a3a50df-42f2-4295-ba92-ad3c3ed9d25f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561293522,"PostDateInt":1787881957000,"PostDate":"2026-08-28T09:52:37","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级导航算法工程师(J14139)","OrgId":700264960,"Org":"算法开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"30K-40K 元/月","Duty":"1. 负责复杂室内/户外环境下的自主导航系统研发，根据轮式/足式载体特性制定差异化策略：\n2. 构建基于3D占据栅格/ESDF/Voxel的动态环境感知模块，实现对低矮障碍、悬空障碍及负障碍的精准识别与安全走廊生成；\n3. 开发语义驱动的导航决策系统，支持目标导向搜索、自主探索建图及多点巡航任务调度；\n4. 深度定制ROS2 Navigation Stack，编写适配轮式阿克曼/差速或足式CoM运动学约束的Planner/Controller插件；\n5. 搭建导航仿真与真机测试闭环，持续优化在极端场景下的安全性与流畅度。","Require":"1. 硕士及以上学历，计算机、自动化、机器人等相关专业，3年以上移动机器人导航算法开发经验，有室外巡检、农林机械或足式机器人落地经验者优先；\n2. 精通全局规划（A*/Hybrid A*/RRT*）与局部规划（TEB/DWA/MPPI/Far Planner），并能根据非结构化地形特点进行改进；\n3. 熟悉ROS2 Nav2架构，有自定义Costmap Layer、Planner或Controller的开发经验，理解地形通行代价（Traversability Cost）的建模方法；\n4. 差异化技能（满足其一即可）：\n    轮式方向：熟悉全覆盖路径规划算法（Boustrophedon/Spanning Tree），了解RTK边界跟随控制，有扫地机器人/割草机导航经验；\n    足式方向：了解四足运动学/动力学模型，能将步态周期、抬腿高度、机身姿态融入规划约束，有Terrain Adapter或Footstep Planner经验；\n5. 具备良好的工程素养，能独立完成从仿真验证到真机调试的全流程，擅长分析Bag数据定位长尾问题；\n6. 加分项：熟悉强化学习在运动控制中的应用；有UWB/视觉信标辅助导航经验；参与过RoboCup/ICRA赛事或开源导航框架贡献。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-28T09:52:37","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":nul